# Only the dataset, the fetcher and its CI are published. Everything else in
# this folder (local helpers, notes, ml/) stays out of the repository.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!requirements.txt

!data/
!data/**

!docs/
!docs/data-schema.md

!scripts/
!scripts/fetch_data.py

# Both forms are needed: git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory
# is still excluded.
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/auto-update.yml

# Scratch files the fetcher may leave behind if interrupted
*.tmp
__pycache__/
